{"sections":[{"slug":"单子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"单子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单子</span> (monad) <span lang=\"zh\">是一种具有许多理解方式的对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">很难说哪种理解最为基本</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的单子是自函子范畴</span> $\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">在这种意义上它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个单子</span> $A\\otimes(-)$; <span lang=\"zh\">在这种意义上单子是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">单子上的模</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或叫</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子上的代数</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">是结合代数上的模的推广</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">单子是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">许多</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可理解为某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子上的代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">此时这个单子给出</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">自由代数</span>”. <span lang=\"zh\">这件事可由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子性函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子性函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">描述</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/2-范畴","text":"$2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的理论中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">单子可视为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">从而进一步推广为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到一般的</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松函子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">自函子范畴中的结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">上</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的单子是其自函子范畴</span> $\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">对偶范畴</span> $\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的单子称为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余单子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">更具体地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> ($1$-)<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的单子是一个函子</span> $T\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">带有自然变换</span>\n$\\eta\\colon \\mathrm{id}\\to T$, $\\mu\\colon T^2\\to T$, <span lang=\"zh\">且有两个自然变换</span> $T^3\\to T$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当然</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">上述定义中的</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">也可设为任何</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的对象</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">松</span> 2-<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">等价的定义是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">单子为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/2-范畴","text":"$2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n    1\\to \\mathsf{Cat}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/2-范畴","text":"$2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">内</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的一个单子定义为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松函子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $1 \\to \\mathcal C$ (<span lang=\"zh\">注意区分一个对象</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">上</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的单子与一个</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">内</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的单子</span>).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3>Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的单子</span> $T$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kleisli范畴","text":"Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Kl}$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>,</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Kl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to TY$,</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Kl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to Y$, $Y\\to Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">的复合为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的如下复合</span>:$$\r\nX \\to TY \\to TTZ \\overset{\\mu}{\\to} TZ.\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">伴随给出单子</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">任何一对函子</span> $L\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$, $R\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" $L\\dashv R$ <span lang=\"zh\">都给出一个单子</span> $RL\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">与一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余单子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $LR\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal D$. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随给出单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随给出单子</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">事实上任何单子都是某一对伴随给出的</span>.</p>\n<h3>Set <span lang=\"zh\">上的单子</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/带基点对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">带基点</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span> $\\mathsf {Set}_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf {Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的遗忘函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其对应的自由函子</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">左伴随</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">是对集合添加一个新的点作为基点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这对伴随的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单位","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单位</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf {Set}}\\to RL$ <span lang=\"zh\">是对集合添加一个新的点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这在计算机科学中称作</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">可能单子</span></strong> (maybe monad).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定集合</span> $S$, <span lang=\"zh\">称为状态集合</span> (set of states), "},{"Local":{"url":"/张量-同态伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">同态伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(S\\times)\\dashv (-)^S$ <span lang=\"zh\">的单位</span> $(S\\times -)^S$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为状态单子</span> (state monad).</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则有单子</span> $A\\otimes(-)\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $(-)\\otimes A\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$. <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为</span>\n$$\r\nA \\mapsto (A\\otimes (-)) \\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal C)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是幺半函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而将</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">变为单子</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对象</span> $[0]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">与该结合代数作张量积的函子</span> $[0] \\otimes - \\colon \\Delta_+ \\to \\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于对全序集添加一个最小元</span>, $-\\otimes [0]  \\colon \\Delta_+ \\to \\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">则是添加一个最大元</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">偏序集上的单子</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/偏序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">偏序集</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(P,\\leq)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的单子</span> $T\\colon P\\to P$ <span lang=\"zh\">须满足</span> $x\\leq Tx$, $T^2 = T$. <span lang=\"zh\">这种映射又叫</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">闭包算子</span>”. <span lang=\"zh\">例如拓扑空间的开集的偏序集</span> $\\operatorname{Open}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的闭包运算是一个单子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lawvere--Tierney拓扑","text":"Lawvere–Tierney <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/杠构造","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">杠构造</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}